sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Model/Agent UI
  participant MA as Model API
  participant Pol as Policy Resolver
  participant Cat as Model Catalog
  participant Health
  participant Bind as Binding Store
  participant Audit
  participant Agent as Active Agent
  User->>UI: 选择 task / agent / global 作用域
  UI->>MA: switch_model(scope, model_id, reason)
  MA->>Pol: resolve(scope, role, requirements)
  Pol->>Cat: validate model + capability
  Cat-->>Pol: catalog snapshot
  Pol->>Health: check provider health
  alt 瞬时失败
    Health-->>Pol: unhealthy
    Pol->>Cat: next eligible candidate
  else 永久失败
    Health-->>MA: auth/budget/model_blocked
    MA-->>UI: 422/409 + MODEL_BLOCKED
  end
  Pol->>Bind: create immutable binding
  Bind->>Audit: switch audit
  MA-->>Agent: apply at next turn boundary
  Agent-->>UI: effective binding + source
  Note over Pol,Agent: 不重启进程；设备动作中不打断
